# E8.0 — the generated prospect draft board, ENTIRELY. Regenerate in ~40s via
# `build_prospect_board.py --prospect-savant`; committed: the code + the e8_0_prospect_board.md
# report (which carries every match rate the join report holds). The exports are a point-in-time
